SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agioi Apostoloi\, Dryopida
LOCATION:Dryopida\, Kythnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The feast of the Metropolitan church of Peter and Paul in Dryopida is the village's biggest night and an official municipal event: hierarchical vespers at 19:30 on 28 June\, then from 21:00 a traditional glenti with violins in the square with the Dryopida Cultural Society's dance groups\, and liturgy at 07:30 on the 29th. Dryopida's tiled-roof lanes are pedestrian\; traffic is closed on the approach road\, so park at the edge of the village and walk in.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythnos/#dryopida-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-dryopida
